{"language":"cn","values":[["/names/cn","皮帕"],["/description_i18n/cn","一名迷糊的小法师，经常将事情搞砸却又总能逢凶化吉。"],["/unit_voice_lines/0/text_i18n/cn","希望……希望不要出错……"],["/unit_voice_lines/1/text_i18n/cn","我……我会努力的！"],["/unit_voice_lines/2/text_i18n/cn","混沌——随现！"],["/unit_voice_lines/3/text_i18n/cn","老师，对不起……"],["/unit_voice_lines/4/text_i18n/cn","幸运的一天！"],["/unit_voice_lines/5/text_i18n/cn","嘿，你好啊！哎哟……"],["/resonating_hall_lines/0/text_i18n/cn","嘿！……嗯？怎么没用   嘿！……哎哟，还是不对……"],["/resonating_hall_lines/0/transcript_i18n/en","Aha! Oh, nothing? Right then. Hah! Whoa, not that."],["/resonating_hall_lines/0/transcript_source_i18n/en","manual"],["/resonating_hall_lines/1/text_i18n/cn","呼——我的法杖呢？欸……欸？啊，原来在这里！"],["/resonating_hall_lines/2/text_i18n/cn","混沌……随现！成功啦！再试一次！那、那是……哎哟！"],["/affinity_gift_lines/0/text_i18n/cn","这……这是给我的吗？今天真是太幸运了！"],["/affinity_gift_lines/1/text_i18n/cn","谢谢！我会好好保管的。"],["/skins/0/name_i18n/cn","糊涂小女巫"],["/skins/0/description_i18n/cn","魔法之路因其混乱变得坎坷，也因其多变而格外有趣。"],["/mystical_house_idle_dialogue/0/lines/0/text_i18n/cn","欸，真好玩！"],["/mystical_house_idle_dialogue/0/lines/0/text_source_i18n/en","manual_translation"],["/mystical_house_idle_dialogue/0/lines/1/text_i18n/cn","我刚才好像把松子变没了……"],["/mystical_house_idle_dialogue/0/lines/1/text_source_i18n/en","manual_translation"],["/mystical_house_idle_dialogue/1/lines/0/text_i18n/cn","呃……还有坚果吗？"],["/mystical_house_idle_dialogue/1/lines/0/text_source_i18n/en","manual_translation"],["/affinity_tales/0/text_i18n/cn","除了外表，皮帕还拥有许多类似小动物的特质。例如敏感的嗅觉、纯真的内心……以及有些迷糊、容易过度紧张的性格。"],["/affinity_tales/1/text_i18n/cn","迷糊的女巫、冒失鬼、破坏王……这些与皮帕本人形象格格不入的绰号，都来源于她混乱的魔法能量。她拥有强大的魔法天赋，却天生不擅长控制它。"],["/affinity_tales/2/text_i18n/cn","皮帕在上一家学校的时候，因为魔法异变总计炸坏了四间教室、两间实验室、一座魔法雕像以及137件收藏品，但包括她自己在内的所有现场人员都毫发无损。"],["/affinity_tales/3/text_i18n/cn","皮帕一向认为除了魔法之外，自己的厨艺也是可圈可点的。她的拿手好菜包括：烤松果、烤榛子、蜂蜜杏仁饼干、混合坚果蛋糕以及其他37种包含各类坚果的菜肴。"],["/affinity_tales/4/text_i18n/cn","或许是皮帕的可爱外表太具有欺骗性，总有人觉得她的魔法能力“不值一提”。但多次和皮帕进行过魔法对决练习的科丝蒂曾说过，皮帕有着能击败她的强大实力。"],["/affinity_tales/5/text_i18n/cn","皮帕能够直接和小动物交谈，时不时就能从那些四处闲逛、晒太阳的小动物口中听到些不得了的八卦传闻。从某种意义上来说，皮帕才是莱希拉姆消息最灵通的人……"],["/affinity_tales/6/text_i18n/cn","最近，皮帕正在协助几位老师编写《魔法植物异变全解》。目前书籍编纂进度喜人，这主要归功于皮帕那极易发生异变的魔法天赋，直接缩短了三分之二的实验时间。"],["/affinity_tales/7/text_i18n/cn","“我并不认为皮帕的魔法很危险。相反，我认为魔法异变是一种神奇的天赋。它能赋予魔法师无数的奇妙灵感，用以创造许多新奇、有趣或实用的魔法。”——休的评价。"],["/affinity_tales/8/text_i18n/cn","皮帕拥有惊人的好运气，猜中考题、中奖、避开危险，都不在话下。但在皮帕心中，这些都不值一提。她人生中最幸运的事，是遇到娑丽丝老师。"],["/affinity_tales/9/text_i18n/cn","皮帕并不知道，娑丽丝期待的从来不是她能够做出多么大的成就，而是能快乐、自由、自信地探索魔法世界。"],["/interaction_records/0/preview_i18n/cn","你好呀小姐，我叫漫漫，是<style=\"highlight\"><player_name></style>的使魔！"],["/interaction_records/0/locales/cn","locales/cn/ep6/herohub_story/16411040.json"],["/interaction_records/0/title_i18n/cn","漫漫 & 皮帕"],["/interaction_records/0/locations/0/name_i18n/cn","星湖郡"],["/interaction_records/1/preview_i18n/cn","哎？好运的秘诀？这个嘛……最近我好像没有那么幸运了。"],["/interaction_records/1/locales/cn","locales/cn/ep6/herohub_story/16411090.json"],["/interaction_records/1/title_i18n/cn","皮帕"],["/interaction_records/1/locations/0/name_i18n/cn","星湖郡"],["/interaction_records/2/preview_i18n/cn","不、不会被发现了吧……应该没有违反规定。"],["/interaction_records/2/locales/cn","locales/cn/ep6/herohub_story/16411110.json"],["/interaction_records/2/title_i18n/cn","皮帕"],["/interaction_records/2/locations/0/name_i18n/cn","星湖郡"],["/interaction_records/3/preview_i18n/cn","对不起！我只是想给蘑菇施肥……但我好像搞错了药水，然后就砰——炸了！"],["/interaction_records/3/locales/cn","locales/cn/ep6/herohub_story/16411250.json"],["/interaction_records/3/title_i18n/cn","皮帕"],["/interaction_records/3/locations/0/name_i18n/cn","空境森林"],["/interaction_records/4/preview_i18n/cn","我来给你看一个超级秘密收藏！"],["/interaction_records/4/locales/cn","locales/cn/ep6/herohub_story/16411270.json"],["/interaction_records/4/title_i18n/cn","皮帕"],["/interaction_records/4/locations/0/name_i18n/cn","空境森林"],["/interaction_records/5/preview_i18n/cn","糟了，你的水杯，飞出屋外了！不会落到空境森林里了吧……"],["/interaction_records/5/locales/cn","locales/cn/mn/herohub_story/10415735.json"],["/interaction_records/5/title_i18n/cn","皮帕 & 戴蒙"],["/interaction_records/6/preview_i18n/cn","欸，真好玩！"],["/interaction_records/6/locales/cn","locales/cn/mn/herohub_story/10415749.json"],["/interaction_records/6/machine_locales/en","mt/en/mn/herohub_story/10415749.json"],["/interaction_records/6/title_i18n/cn","皮帕"],["/interaction_records/6/preview_fallback_i18n/en",{"text":"Hey, this is so much fun!","source_cn":"欸，真好玩！","status":"machine_translation_csv","source_file":"mt/en/mn/herohub_story/10415749.json","text_key":"say:1:1041574901:0","asset_key":"mn/herohub_story_10415749"}],["/interaction_records/7/preview_i18n/cn","呃……还有坚果吗？"],["/interaction_records/7/locales/cn","locales/cn/mn/herohub_story/10415750.json"],["/interaction_records/7/machine_locales/en","mt/en/mn/herohub_story/10415750.json"],["/interaction_records/7/title_i18n/cn","皮帕"],["/interaction_records/7/preview_fallback_i18n/en",{"text":"Uh... do you still have nuts?","source_cn":"呃……还有坚果吗？","status":"machine_translation_csv","source_file":"mt/en/mn/herohub_story/10415750.json","text_key":"say:0:1041575001:0","asset_key":"mn/herohub_story_10415750"}],["/interaction_records/8/preview_i18n/cn","听着，皮帕，如果等会有守备军找了过来，你就说你没看见我！"],["/interaction_records/8/locales/cn","locales/cn/mn/herohub_story/10415766.json"],["/interaction_records/8/title_i18n/cn","佩吉 & 皮帕"]]}